    "description": "The TimpFest App is your official electronic guide to the Timpanogos Storytelling Festival! Organize and expand your Festival experience in one handy app. Create your own personalized schedule; get to know the storytellers, musicians, and performers; find your way around the Festival using our zoomable maps; and learn about our amazing sponsors.",
